                description  : The club, founded in 1900, play soccer in the 2. Bundesliga, Germany's second division. In 2017 the stadium was renamed for famous player Max Morlock, but the S-bahn station still reflects a former name &quot;Frankenstadion&quot;. &lt;br&gt;
